ent-MobLavalandGoliathAncient = ancient goliath
    .desc = Goliaths are biologically immortal, and rare specimens have survived for centuries. This one is clearly ancient, and its tentacles constantly churn the earth around it.
    .suffix = Lavaland
ent-MobLegion = legion humanoid
    .desc = You can still see what was once a human under the shifting mass of corruption.
ent-MobLegionSkull = legion skull
    .desc = A fragment of the original legion, rallying behind its original. One isn't much of a threat, but...
ent-LavalandMobAshWhelp = ash whelp
    .desc = The offspring of an ash drake, weak in comparison but still terrifying.

ent-CitadelRPMobGoliathCalf = goliath calf
    .desc = Goliaths may be naturally immortal, but they are still vulnerable. Calves are a rare sight on the surface.
ent-CitadelRPMobGutlunch = gutlunch
    .desc = A scavenger that eats raw ores, often found alongside ash walkers.
ent-CitadelRPMobGutshank = gutshank
    .desc = These dog-sized parasites sport thick, chitinous shells which protect them from both attacks and the heat.
ent-CitadelRPMobShank = shank
    .desc = This agile insectoid beast uses its maneuverability and flexible carapace to protect it when running down its prey.
ent-CitadelRPMobSandSifter = sand sifter
    .desc = A small snail-like creature that feeds on minerals and organic matter it finds in ash sand.
ent-CitadelRPMobStormdrifter = stormdrifter polyp
    .desc = These curious entities are able to fly thanks to the gaseous bags which comprise most of their body. They are generally passive, unless threatened.
ent-CitadelRPMobBulldrifter = stormdrifter bull
    .desc = Unlike the more passive Polyp, Stormdrifter Bulls are hardy and formidable. Fiercely territorial, Bulls will aggressively protect Stormdrifter pods.
ent-CitadelRPMobBasilisk = basilisk
    .desc = A territorial beast, covered in a diamond shell which absorbs heat. Its stare causes victims to freeze from the inside.
ent-CitadelRPMobGoldgrub = goldgrub
    .desc = A worm that grows fat from eating everything in its sight. Seems to enjoy precious metals and other shiny things, hence the name.
ent-CitadelRPMobCurseBlob = curse blob
    .desc = A writhing knot of dark energy that drifts after anything living.
ent-CitadelRPMobDwarfLegion = dwarf legion
    .desc = You can still see what was once a rather small human under the shifting mass of corruption.

ent-ActionGoliathCalfTentacle = tentacles

